    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just... gone. like actually gone. i wake up and i realize that the person everyone knew, the person i actually was, doesn't exist anymore. it's like my whole life was just a profile that got deleted and now i'm just stuck in this shell of a person that nobody wants and nobody even recognizes. it feels like i'm already dead, honestly.",
